{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/o6ctm43tqo",
  "title": "Google Search Console Soft 404 问题解决方案",
  "author": "Masterdai",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/o6ctm43tqo_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "经验"
  ],
  "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">最近在谷歌的 Search Console 发现我的几个页面出现了 Soft 404 的问题</h2>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/o6ctm43tqo_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>但我发现官方的回答不能解决我的问题、我的页面和内容都是经过优化的，之前从来没出过类似的问题。于是我在网上搜索，发现这是一个很多人遇到的通用问题和<strong>15.0 版本部署在 Vercel 的 Next.js 网页有关</strong>。</div>\n<div>我找了一些解决资料希望能帮到群友。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">有几种原因</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">第一种是频繁部署导致的</h3>\n<div>来自 <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/nextjs/comments/1ijmhqx/soft_404_on_nextjs_webpages_hosted_on_vercel/?share_id=QXI0T1NpSyg0p61VzWGzM&amp;utm_content=2&amp;utm_medium=ios_app&amp;utm_name=ioscss&amp;utm_source=share&amp;utm_term=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reddit 论坛</a>的一个回答：</div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.academicjobs.com/dyn/failing-dynamic-routes-in-next-js\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.academicjobs.com/dyn/failing-dynamic-routes-in-next-js</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div>发生这种情况的原因是 Googlebot 在获取初始页面和呈现页面之间需要时间：</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div>Googlebot 首先抓取 HTML，然后（几小时或几天后）尝试呈现它；如果您在此期间部署，则旧 HTML 中列出的散列 JS 文件将消失，它们将出现 404，呈现失败，并且 Google 会将该 URL 记录为\"软 404\"。</div>\n</blockquote>\n<div><strong>解决方案：</strong>（这个方案在 15.4 已经修复了）</div>\n<div>添加到 <code>robots.txt</code>：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">Disallow</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>_next</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">static</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>chunks</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>app</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">第二种未知但是可能和版本有关</h3>\n<div>来自 GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/discussions/78288\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">的讨论</a> 和 Vercel CTO 的<a href=\"https://x.com/cramforce/status/1845496746245546365\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">回答</a></div>\n<div><strong>解决方案：</strong> 在路由里面添加 <code>GracefullyDegradingErrorBoundary</code></div>\n<div>参考文档：<a href=\"https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/file-conventions/error#graceful-error-recovery-with-a-custom-error-boundary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/file-conventions/error#graceful-error-recovery-with-a-custom-error-boundary</a>.</div>\n<div><br>\n这是我目前找到的几个解决方案，如果还有其他的方案欢迎群友在下方留言讨论。</div>",
